---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Consulting" description="Data strategy, grant writing, and organizational change consulting for nonprofits and education organizations.">
	<main class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<div class="mb-24">
			<p class="mb-4 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary text-sm">
				Strategic Consulting
			</p>
			<h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
				Data, strategy, and execution for mission-driven organizations.
			</h1>
			<p class="mb-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-700 sm:text-xl">
				I help nonprofits and education organizations build their analytics, win the grants that fund the work, and lead the change that follows.
			</p>
			<p class="mb-8 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
				I've led strategy at DC CAP, built the analytics and research functions at Common App, and managed relationships with partner organizations and major funders. I bring strategic depth and operational experience to a range of engagements.
			</p>
			<a
				href="https://calendly.com/preston-magouirk"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-neutral-900 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white transition-all hover:bg-neutral-800 hover:shadow-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-neutral-900 focus:ring-offset-2"
			>
				Schedule time to meet
				<svg
					class="ml-2 h-4 w-4"
					fill="none"
					stroke="currentColor"
					viewBox="0 0 24 24"
				>
					<path
						stroke-linecap="round"
						stroke-linejoin="round"
						stroke-width="2"
						d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"
					></path>
				</svg>
			</a>
		</div>

		<!-- Services Section -->
		<section class="mb-24">
			<h2 class="mb-12 text-3xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl">
				How I Help
			</h2>
			<div class="space-y-16">
				<!-- Service 1: Data & Analytics Strategy -->
				<article class="border-t border-primary/10 pt-12">
					<div class="mb-6">
						<h3 class="mb-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 sm:text-3xl">
							Data & Analytics Strategy
						</h3>
						<p class="text-lg font-medium text-primary">Data your team actually uses.</p>
					</div>
					<p class="mb-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
						Most organizations collect more data than they use. The dashboards exist, but they gather dust, and leaders who call themselves "data-driven" often lack clean data, clear outcomes, and the habit of using either. I help close that gap.
					</p>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
						<div>
							<h4 class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-600">
								What I offer
							</h4>
							<ul class="space-y-3 text-base text-neutral-700">
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Analytics strategy and roadmap development</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Salesforce and CRM optimization for program teams</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Dashboard design and KPI/OKR development</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Data infrastructure assessment and modernization</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Training and capacity building for internal teams</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Ad-hoc data/analytics product development</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
						<div>
							<h4 class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-600">
								Results I've delivered
							</h4>
							<ul class="space-y-3 text-base text-neutral-700">
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Built the analytics environment for Common App, the largest source of college application data in the U.S.</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Led DC CAP's Salesforce Education Cloud rollout, saving $500K+ a year and cutting administrative load by more than half</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Built the financial modeling tools behind a $10M+ organization's multi-year strategy and budget</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Built secure, accessible analytics pipelines that generate branded reports, dashboards, and visualizations</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- Service 2: Grant Writing & Proposal Development -->
				<article class="border-t border-primary/10 pt-12">
					<div class="mb-6">
						<h3 class="mb-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 sm:text-3xl">
							Grant Writing & Proposal Development
						</h3>
						<p class="text-lg font-medium text-primary">Translate your impact into funded proposals.</p>
					</div>
					<p class="mb-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
						Competitive grants demand more than good intentions. Funders want a clear theory of change, credible evaluation design, and evidence you can execute. Strong programs lose ground when the narrative raises more questions than it answers, or the methodology undercuts confidence in the team. I write the proposals that close both gaps.
					</p>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
						<div>
							<h4 class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-600">
								What I offer
							</h4>
							<ul class="space-y-3 text-base text-neutral-700">
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Full grant proposal development (federal, foundation, corporate)</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Theory of change and logic model design</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Evaluation framework and methodology sections</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Budget narrative and cost justification</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Proposal review, strengthening, and red-teaming</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
						<div>
							<h4 class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-600">
								Results I've delivered
							</h4>
							<ul class="space-y-3 text-base text-neutral-700">
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Managed long-term relationships with large-scale funders across multiple organizations</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Built the strategy that won a $600K AI innovation grant (KPMG AI Impact Initiative)</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Contributed to $50M+ in philanthropic commitments at DC CAP, including MacKenzie Scott / Yield Giving</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>PhD training in program evaluation, causal inference, and quantitative methods</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Led randomized controlled trials of strategic initiatives, funded by national research grants</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- Service 3: Organizational Change & Strategic Transitions -->
				<article class="border-t border-primary/10 pt-12">
					<div class="mb-6">
						<h3 class="mb-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 sm:text-3xl">
							Organizational Change & Strategic Transitions
						</h3>
						<p class="text-lg font-medium text-primary">Make the change stick.</p>
					</div>
					<p class="mb-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
						Restructures, mergers, new strategic directions, leadership transitions. Each one puts strategy and people under pressure at the same time. Change sticks when leaders pair clear frameworks with disciplined communication and real attention to how people experience the shift. Most organizations underinvest in execution.
					</p>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
						<div>
							<h4 class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-600">
								What I offer
							</h4>
							<ul class="space-y-3 text-base text-neutral-700">
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Strategic planning design and facilitation</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Organizational restructuring and team integration</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Change management frameworks and implementation support</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Partnership development and optimization</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Operational efficiency assessment and process redesign</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
						<div>
							<h4 class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-600">
								Results I've delivered
							</h4>
							<ul class="space-y-3 text-base text-neutral-700">
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Led the integration of four teams into a unified Student Success division at DC CAP</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Directed the shift from a national to a regional partnership model, lifting first-year retention to 85%+ and graduation to 75–95% at established partners</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Led an enterprise-wide digital transformation that cut administrative time by more than half</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<span class="mr-3 mt-1.5 text-primary">→</span>
									<span>Designed new supervision frameworks for cross-functional coaching teams</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Engagement Models Section -->
		<section class="mb-24 border-t border-secondary/10 pt-16">
			<h2 class="mb-12 text-3xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl">
				How We Work Together
			</h2>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
				<div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6 transition-all hover:shadow-sm">
					<h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900">Advisory Retainer</h3>
					<p class="mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
						Ongoing strategic counsel, typically 3-5 hours monthly. Regular check-ins, asynchronous support, and priority access for emerging challenges.
					</p>
					<p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary">
						Organizations wanting a trusted thought partner over time
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6 transition-all hover:shadow-sm">
					<h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900">Project-Based</h3>
					<p class="mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
						Defined scope, timeline, and deliverables. Clear milestones and structured collaboration from kickoff to completion.
					</p>
					<p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary">
						Grant proposals, strategic plans, or system implementations
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6 transition-all hover:shadow-sm">
					<h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900">Intensive Sprint</h3>
					<p class="mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
						Concentrated engagement over 2-4 weeks. Deep immersion to accelerate progress on urgent priorities.
					</p>
					<p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary">
						Time-sensitive decisions, board presentations, or funding deadlines
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- CTA Section -->
		<section class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-12 sm:p-16">
			<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
				<h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl">
					Let's talk about what you're building.
				</h2>
				<p class="mb-10 text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-700 sm:text-xl">
					I take on a limited number of consulting engagements so each client gets focused attention. If you're facing a strategic challenge, building new organizational capacity, or managing a major transition, I'd welcome the conversation.
				</p>
				<div class="mb-6 flex justify-center">
					<a
						href="https://calendly.com/preston-magouirk"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
						class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-neutral-900 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white transition-all hover:bg-neutral-800 hover:shadow-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-neutral-900 focus:ring-offset-2"
					>
						Schedule time to meet
						<svg
							class="ml-2 h-4 w-4"
							fill="none"
							stroke="currentColor"
							viewBox="0 0 24 24"
						>
							<path
								stroke-linecap="round"
								stroke-linejoin="round"
								stroke-width="2"
								d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"
							></path>
						</svg>
					</a>
				</div>
				<p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">
					Based in Washington, D.C. Available for remote engagements.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
